id: chaos-free-mark
name: Chaos Unleashed
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
combatCondition: no
source: Pure Form
description: >
  Unpredictable (5): the Ki Point Cost of your Attacking Maneuvers reduced to 0 till the end of the Combat Round.
text: >
  (5)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Round]: Spend 2 stacks of Channeled Chaos. Until the end of this Combat Round, the Ki Point Cost of your Attacking Maneuvers is reduced to 0.

---

[passive]
attack.kiCost *= 0;
